---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | NYCUNO"
  description="Read NYCUNO's Privacy Policy."
  currentPage="Privacy Policy"
>
  <main class="mx-auto w-full max-w-site flex-1 px-4 py-12.5 sm:px-6">
    <section>
      <h1
        class="relative mb-7 pb-5 font-sans text-[35px] font-medium leading-none text-brand after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-px after:w-[50px] after:bg-brand"
      >
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[15px] font-normal leading-[26px] text-[#404040]">
        <p>
          <strong>Introduction</strong>
        </p>

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy outlines how NYCUNO Incorporated, along with its
          subsidiaries, affiliates, and associated entities (collectively
          referred to as "NYCUNO," "we," "us," or "our"), gathers, utilizes,
          processes, and shares your personal information through our mobile
          applications, websites ("Apps" and "Websites"), and other services we
          provide globally (collectively, "Services"). This policy applies to
          all users, including consumers, agents, vendors, suppliers, partners
          (such as drivers, delivery personnel, and merchants), contractors,
          and service providers (collectively referred to as "you" or "your").
        </p>

        <p>
          "Personal Information" refers to any data that can be used to identify
          you or from which you can be identified. This includes but is not
          limited to your name, nationality, phone number, financial details,
          interests, email address, images, government IDs, biometric data,
          race, birthdate, marital status, religion, health details, vehicle
          information, employment history, and financial records.
        </p>

        <p>
          We typically collect, use, disclose, or process your Personal
          Information with your consent or in compliance with applicable laws,
          such as when:
        </p>

        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li>Required to meet legal obligations;</li>
          <li>Necessary to enter into or fulfill a contract with you; and/or</li>
          <li>
            Pursuant to our legitimate interests or those of others, including
            the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-medium text-text">
          I. COLLECTION OF PERSONAL INFORMATION
        </h2>

        <p>
          We gather Personal Information about you in several ways and may
          combine data collected through various channels:
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">Provided by You</h3>

        <p>We collect your Personal Information when you provide it, such as when you:</p>

        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li>Complete registration forms or customize your profile;</li>
          <li>
            Submit information for eligibility assessments as a driver or
            delivery partner;
          </li>
          <li>
            Provide supporting documents like proof of disability or discount
            eligibility;
          </li>
          <li>
            Share details to become a merchant partner, vendor, supplier, or
            other partner;
          </li>
          <li>Engage with our social media pages;</li>
          <li>Participate in contests or events;</li>
          <li>Fill out surveys;</li>
          <li>Apply for loans, insurance claims, or financing products;</li>
          <li>Contact us via customer support channels;</li>
          <li>Agree to rides with audio/video recording features;</li>
          <li>Verify your identity through various methods; and</li>
          <li>Interact with our AI-powered services.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">Through Service Usage</h3>

        <p>
          Personal Information may be collected during the normal operation of
          our Apps, Websites, and Services, including:
        </p>

        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li>Location data;</li>
          <li>Feedback and ratings;</li>
          <li>Transaction details;</li>
          <li>Interaction data with our platforms;</li>
          <li>Device information;</li>
          <li>Telematics data;</li>
          <li>Communication content within our apps; and</li>
          <li>Audio/video recordings during rides.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">In-Vehicle Applications or Devices</h3>

        <p>
          We may install audio/video recording devices in vehicles to enhance
          safety and security for drivers, delivery partners, and passengers.
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">From Other Sources</h3>

        <p>
          We may collect Personal Information from sources like referral
          programs, business partners, credit bureaus, public records, emergency
          contacts, and marketing partners.
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">Sensitive Personal Information</h3>

        <p>
          Some collected data may be sensitive, such as racial or ethnic
          origin, religious beliefs, health data, or biometric information. We
          collect such data only with your consent and in strict compliance
          with applicable laws.
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">Providing Others' Information</h3>

        <p>
          If you provide Personal Information about others, you confirm you have
          their consent for collection, use, and disclosure as described herein.
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">Minors' Information</h3>

        <p>
          Parents or guardians should not allow minors to submit Personal
          Information. If disclosed, you consent to its processing and accept
          responsibility for the minor's actions.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-medium text-text">
          II. USE OF PERSONAL INFORMATION
        </h2>

        <p>
          NYCUNO may use your Personal Information for the following purposes
          ("Purposes"):
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">Service Delivery</h3>

        <p>
          To provide, personalize, maintain, and improve our offerings,
          including:
        </p>

        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li>Account management;</li>
          <li>Eligibility verification;</li>
          <li>Payment processing;</li>
          <li>Safety monitoring;</li>
          <li>Personalized experiences;</li>
          <li>Internal operations and analysis;</li>
          <li>Security protection;</li>
          <li>User communications;</li>
          <li>Event participation; and</li>
          <li>Partner resource allocation.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">Safety and Security</h3>

        <p>To ensure the safety and integrity of our Services, including:</p>

        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li>Driver screening;</li>
          <li>Unsafe behavior detection;</li>
          <li>Identity verification;</li>
          <li>Fraud prevention;</li>
          <li>Emergency response; and</li>
          <li>Compliance monitoring.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">User Support</h3>

        <p>To resolve support issues, including:</p>

        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li>Concern investigation;</li>
          <li>Response improvement;</li>
          <li>Feedback handling; and</li>
          <li>Issue resolution communication.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">Research and Development</h3>

        <p>
          For testing, analysis, machine learning, and product development to
          enhance our Services and develop new features.
        </p>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">Legal Purposes</h3>

        <p>For legal reasons, such as:</p>

        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li>Dispute resolution;</li>
          <li>Crime prevention;</li>
          <li>Legal compliance; and</li>
          <li>Rights protection.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="font-semibold text-text">Marketing and Promotions</h3>

        <p>To send marketing communications, including:</p>

        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li>Special offers;</li>
          <li>Newsletters;</li>
          <li>Event invitations; and</li>
          <li>Promotional materials.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          You can opt out of marketing communications via unsubscribe links or
          app settings, though essential service messages will still be sent.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-medium text-text">
          III. DISCLOSURE OF PERSONAL INFORMATION
        </h2>

        <p>
          We share Personal Information with various parties for the Purposes,
          including:
        </p>

        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li>Other users;</li>
          <li>Third parties related to your use of Services;</li>
          <li>Account administrators;</li>
          <li>Subsidiaries and affiliates;</li>
          <li>Service providers and business partners;</li>
          <li>Legal advisors and authorities; and</li>
          <li>Parties involved in business transactions.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-medium text-text">
          IV. RETENTION OF PERSONAL INFORMATION
        </h2>

        <p>
          We retain your Personal Information for as long as necessary to
          fulfill the Purposes, unless a longer period is required or permitted
          by law. For example, selfie images are retained for up to ten years
          unless otherwise required.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-medium text-text">
          V. INTERNATIONAL DATA TRANSFERS
        </h2>

        <p>
          Your Personal Information may be transferred internationally. We
          comply with legal obligations and ensure adequate protection measures
          are in place.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-medium text-text">
          VI. COOKIES AND RELATED TECHNOLOGIES
        </h2>

        <p>
          We use cookies and similar technologies for various purposes,
          including functionality, analytics, and advertising. You can manage
          cookie preferences through browser settings or app options.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-medium text-text">
          VII. PROTECTION OF PERSONAL INFORMATION
        </h2>

        <p>
          We implement reasonable measures to protect your Personal
          Information, though internet transmissions are not entirely secure.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-medium text-text">
          VIII. YOUR RIGHTS
        </h2>

        <p>Under applicable laws, you may have rights to:</p>

        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
          <li>Access and receive copies of your data;</li>
          <li>Correct or delete your data;</li>
          <li>Restrict or object to processing;</li>
          <li>Withdraw consent;</li>
          <li>Data portability; and</li>
          <li>Lodge complaints with data protection authorities.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          Withdrawing consent may affect our ability to provide certain
          Services.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-medium text-text">
          IX. AMENDMENTS
        </h2>

        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy, notifying you at least five
          business days before changes take effect. Continued use of our
          Services constitutes acceptance of any amendments.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
